      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "FYI this only happens if changing the checkbox is the only thing you change in your scene. If you do anything else, it should be saved.\nTurn on the checkbox, and then change the x position on that object's transform, for example, and then change it back. This should enable you to save your scene, including that property change.\nWe'll fix this issue though, thanks @{5a983204a1528d415c5ced46|full_name}.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
